---
description:
  Verifies that a classDef applied to several nodes via a class statement
  correctly sets fill, text color, font-weight, and stroke on each of them,
  under the hand-drawn look.
config:
  layout: layered
  look: handDrawn
  fontFamily: courier
copyOf: flowchart/nightly-check/handdrawn/should-style-nodes-via-a-class.mmd
---
graph TD
  1A --> 1B
  1B --> 1C
  1C --> D
  1C --> E

  classDef processHead fill:#888888,color:white,font-weight:bold,stroke-width:3px,stroke:#001f3f
  class 1A,1B,D,E processHead
